@startuml
actor Driver
participant "Driver Orders UI" as UI
participant "Driver OrderController" as C
database DB

Driver -> UI: ضغط قبول
UI -> C: POST /driver/orders/{id}/accept
C -> DB: تحقق الحالة + التعيين
DB --> C: success/fail
alt success
  C --> UI: success message
else fail
  C --> UI: error message
end
@enduml
